// Amounts (L. 821-3-1, D. 821-2): uncapped monthly figures, both regimes.
//
// «Le montant de l'allocation ... est fixé par décret» (L. 821-3-1): the
// monthly amount is montant_aah_applicable of 07-montant-chaine.law — the
// pinned decree amount of the window (decrees 2019-1047 ... 2026-229, chain
// of the L. 161-25 coefficients built and checked there, DECISION-0452), or
// the case-supplied montant_mensuel_retenu, which prevails over the decree.
// «Le bénéficiaire ... a droit, mensuellement, à une allocation égale au
// douzième de la différence entre le montant du plafond applicable et les
// ressources annuelles» (D. 821-2, para. 3), «ou ... au tiers de la
// différence ... [trimestrielles]» for the R. 821-4-1 track, «sans que
// cette allocation puisse excéder le montant mensuel» (cap at M).
// Eligibility threshold (para. 1): resources below twelve (resp. three)
// times the monthly amount. Plafond (para. 2): +81 % for a couple under
// the pre-2023 wording, +50 % per dependent child under both wordings.
// Spouse resources feed the pre-2023 computation (former L. 821-3).
// The ESAT cap (D. 821-5) is applied in 05-cumul-esat.law; the 2022-1694
// choice between the two figures in 04-deconjugalisation.law.
//
// MONEY FORMS (pf-af convention): multiplications Money x Decimal
// (bareme fractions), divisions Money / Decimal ("/ 12.0"): exact division, a
// non-terminating quotient is INEXACT_DIVISION. Rounding of the douzième and the
// tiers is the READING DouziemeTiersArrondiCentime (section "Reading D-82/D-83"
// at the end of this file), selected in the context of the case.

language "law.core" version "0.2";
package fr.css.aah version "0.1.0";
namespace "urn:fr:corpus:clir:aah";

